ft" data-v-0fef0ebb><div class="content align-left" data-v-0fef0ebb><!----><h2 class="module-title page-font-type-NORMAL" data-animation-up-show style="color:#000;" data-v-0fef0ebb>Guangzhou Automobile Group</h2><p class="module-description" data-animation-up-show style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);" data-v-0fef0ebb>Guangzhou Automobile Group Co., Ltd.(&quot;GAC&quot;) was incorporated in June 1997. Over the past 28 years , GAC has stayed true to a customer-centric, market-oriented, and innovation-driven approach to achieve sustained and progressive growth. It produced over 29.7 million vehicles accumulatively, with a total industrial output of RMB 4.8 trillion.</p><div data-animation-up-show class="btn-wrap" data-v-0fef0ebb><!--[--><a href="/en/gac-group" class="a-link no-to-rem link4px base-button-box white" data-v-0fef0ebb><!--[-->Learn More<!--]--></a><!--]--></div></div><div class="item-image" data-v-0fef0ebb><picture class="loading-img" data-v-0fef0ebb data-v-97700266><!----><img src data-src="https://br-www-resouce-cdn.gacgroup.com/static/Global/tenant/cms/common/202503/81604d42-dbb2-4708-8ba4-50733a13365f.png" class="lazyload" data-expand="800" load-mode="1" loading fetchpriority data-animation-scale alt="Guangzhou Automobile Group | Guangzhou Automobile Group Co., Ltd.(&quot;GAC&quot;) was incorporated in June 1997. Over the past 28 years , GAC has stayed true to a customer-centric, market-oriented, and innovation-driven approach to achieve sustained and progressive growth. It produced over 29.7 million vehicles accumulatively, with a total industrial output of RMB 4.8 trillion." data-v-97700266></picture></div></div><!--]--><!----></div><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--></div><!----><!----><!----><!--[--><!--]--></div><!----><!--]--><!--]--></div></section><section data-template-box class="template-box" style="background-color:rgb(247, 247, 247);" data-v-da8ea5c6><!----><div class="template-box-content" data-v-da8ea5c6><!--[--><!--[--><div class="swiper image-text-wrap" styl